---
description: Next.js player and Archive dashboard
globs: web/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Next.js App Router, TypeScript strict, Tailwind. Server components by default, client components only for audio and live updates.
- The API is the only backend. The web app never talks to the database or LLMs directly.
- Generate API types from the FastAPI OpenAPI schema (`openapi-typescript`). Do not hand write response types.
- Core screens: Player (audio + synced transcript, click a sentence to see its sources), Archive (briefing timeline, rejection log, latency per stage).
- Every spoken sentence in the UI links to its claim trace. This is the main demo, keep it fast.
